{
  "id": "b2-e44-rules-and-laws",
  "level": "B2",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Rules and laws",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good evening. First of all, we'd like to know something about you.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e44-rules-and-laws/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, are there any rules at work or school that you do not like?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e44-rules-and-laws/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, do you always follow rules?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e44-rules-and-laws/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3300
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, what rules did you have at home when you were younger?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e44-rules-and-laws/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, are you a person who likes to plan everything?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e44-rules-and-laws/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4200
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you two photographs. I'd like you to talk about them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question about your partner's photographs.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e44-rules-and-laws/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13000
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "b2-e44-a1",
            "b2-e44-a2"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your photographs show people dealing with rules. Compare the photographs, and say why the rules might be important.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e44-rules-and-laws/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 8800
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think rules are always necessary?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e44-rules-and-laws/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4000
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "b2-e44-b1",
            "b2-e44-b2"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your photographs show people behaving in different ways. Compare the photographs, and say what might happen as a result.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e44-rules-and-laws/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 9000
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, what should happen to people who ignore rules?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e44-rules-and-laws/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some things that can help people follow the law, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e44-rules-and-laws/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 10400
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "b2-e44-rules-and-laws",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these things help people follow the law?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e44-rules-and-laws/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6000
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "b2-e44-rules-and-laws",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which would be the most effective?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e44-rules-and-laws/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about rules and laws.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e44-rules-and-laws/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4900
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Some people say that there are too many rules nowadays. What do you think?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e44-rules-and-laws/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4900
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think young people respect rules less than before?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e44-rules-and-laws/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5000
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, should punishments be harder for people who break the law many times?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e44-rules-and-laws/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5600
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Is it ever right to break a law?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e44-rules-and-laws/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 2700
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, how can communities encourage people to follow the rules without punishments?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e44-rules-and-laws/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6500
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
